# CTRLO-OTHER-PICKERS: Ctrl-O over the session picker (/resume) with two
# saved sessions, then one key at a time between a Ctrl-O and its return.
# fx closes the full transcript before every frame while this menu is up
# (reconcileBeforeFrameRender, app_render_runtime.zig:1206-1215@481104fd), so
# Ctrl-O over it shows nothing and every key below is the menu's own, as
# without Ctrl-O: `held` is the composer's plane with the menu, C-j and C-k
# move the mark (routePickerControlByte, app_input_runtime.zig:1093-1116),
# Escape closes the menu (resolveEscape, :2765).
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
gateway resume-turns.json
wait 4
type first question alpha
key Enter
wait 4
type /new
key Enter
wait 2
type second question beta
key Enter
wait 4
type /new
key Enter
wait 2
type /resume
key Enter
wait 2
snap open
key C-o
wait 0.8
snap held
key C-o
wait 0.8
key C-o
wait 0.8
key Down
wait 0.4
key C-o
wait 0.8
snap down
key C-o
wait 0.8
key C-k
wait 0.4
key C-o
wait 0.8
snap ck
key C-o
wait 0.8
key C-j
wait 0.4
key C-o
wait 0.8
snap cj
key C-o
wait 0.8
key Tab
wait 0.4
key C-o
wait 0.8
snap tab
key C-o
wait 0.8
key Escape
wait 0.8
snap esc
